 "assumptions": [
  "Cold pair (CwSsimPyiqa cold evaluate (warm + score_warm)): warm_reference builds the size plan (frequency grid, every f32 mask, Gaussian weight; images 1) and the reference bands; score_warm builds the distorted bands and the similarity. A warm reference removes one image from every images-2 stage and the plan stages.",
  "Only pyiqa's scored level is computed: the full-size spectrum, three crop+lomask rounds, and the eight level-4 bands. pyiqa also builds the finer levels' bands, the high-pass and the low-pass residual (unused by the score); they are not counted.",
  "FFT: rustfft mixed radix, counted as radix-2 equivalent: per element per log2 level 2 mul + 3 add (one complex multiply per butterfly pair plus two complex adds), log2(W)+log2(H) levels for the 2-D transform; Bluestein sizes counted the same. Loads/stores 4 each (row pass in place, column pass gathered).",
  "np.interp: binary search counted as ceil(log2(table)) compares (259-entry radial table: 9; 3,075-entry angular table: 12) plus 2 range compares; 4 add/sub, 1 mul, 1 div; rounding to f32 as cvt.",
  "Negation (multiply by i, conj) counted as abs-class.",
  "box7 as written: 49 (k*v) multiplies and 49 adds per output, three planes per orientation."
 ],
